        <mxCell id="c21" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading&lt;/b&gt;: the router is 0.41 below the ensemble it was meant to beat (rule needs +2). Both experts chose the same 0.3 weight, so the &#39;two experts&#39; collapse into the ensemble. The gap to the perfect gate (+9.2) is all in the seen/unseen decision." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
