        <mxCell id="c68" value="&lt;b&gt;Bottom line&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Test HM 75.0 &#39;at γ = 0&#39; is real but is &lt;b&gt;calibrated by the gate&lt;/b&gt;: it routes images exactly as v6.3&#39;s γ does (±0.4 pts per bucket).&lt;br&gt;• Recognition is unchanged (same closed-set Top-1) and AUSUC is 1.5 lower.&lt;br&gt;• Not kept: val 65.61 vs 66.02.&lt;br&gt;• Headroom exists (perfect gate 75.25 val) but needs better within-crop disease recognition, not a better gate." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#fff0f0;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="650" width="620" height="230" as="geometry" />
